WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.390
<b>Shirobori Middle School</b>

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:04.100
Quiet down.

00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:04.100
<b>Ainosuke Takuramakan
Veronica Borowczyk
Nina Mikhailovna Pavlova (Ninotchka)</b>

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.980
This is rather unusual, but we have 
three transfer students joining us.

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:10.970
Tateyan?

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:11.480
Um...

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.930
Ninotchka-san!

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:15.360
Will you be the futsal club manager?

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.110
What?!

00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:18.020
Um... Me?

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:19.240
What's with him?

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.850
Hey, Tateno. Are you 
already hitting on her?

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:23.860
Yeah, pretty much.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:26.410
He's not even denying it.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.640
That boy transfer student...

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.960
If his hobby is bodybuilding to go along 
with that face, he's very much my type.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.960
I don't think I really like that...

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.090
Dr. Love is popular, too.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:38.560
They're totally being fooled 
by his appearance!

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:41.230
He's actually a 500-year-old 
perverted scientist inside!

00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:43.600
I'm sure what's on his mind right now is...

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:48.860
The weather is great again today, 
so let's begin the Taklamakan Project here.

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:50.850
Yes, Dr. Love.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.360
You brought the tanning lotion 
and mat, right?

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.600
Yes, Dr. Love.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:57.940
Now, take off your clothes.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.610
Will you put this on instead?

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:06.860
Yes, Dr. Love.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:11.620
I want to let everyone know 
how dangerous he is!

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:13.670
I'm pretty sure people think you're 
dangerous right now, too.

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:14.220
Huh?

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:16.150
Huh?

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.730
<b>Misuzu's Lie</b>

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:51.020
<b>Shirobori Middle School</b>

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.020
Hey, Misuzu.

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:56.180
What am I going to do if that transfer boy's 
soleus muscle is perfectly cut?

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:57.850
Jeez.

00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:59.400
What transfer boy?

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:03.650
Ideally for me, I hope he just 
has protein in his bag.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:08.770
Oh, man. I'm so tempted to peek in his bag 
when we clean the classroom.

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:10.200
That's a crime.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:14.160
I'm so surprised that Misuzu 
goes to this school.

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.830
Why didn't you say anything?

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:21.420
Oh? Misuzu, you know the transfer girl?

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:24.410
No. This is the first time I've seen you.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.510
You've got the wrong person.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:27.490
That's a good answer.

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:31.250
I have a higher rank than you 
at work. I'll give you credit.

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:33.760
At school, we're on common ground.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.600
I think you know this,

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:40.360
but I'm not going to lose to you 
in academics or P.E., Misuzu!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.650
Wh-What?

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:44.600
Is there a fight?

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:48.200
<i>Those two are suddenly in a hostile mood.</i>

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.450
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:54.320
Hey, what about love? Will you not 
lose to Misuzu in love, either?

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.320
Shh!

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:56.560
What's with this girl?

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:57.950
Toku-chan...

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:01.120
Veronica! Let's go. Come on.

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.770
What? It was just getting good!

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:07.400
Ninotchka is like a responsible adult.

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.330
True...

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:09.760
Chuta!

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.550
Come here.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:13.720
Huh? Bowling?

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:17.460
Yeah. When I invited Ninotchka-chan 
bowling after school,

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:21.210
she said she'd consider it if you, Sonokata, 
and the other transfer students came, too.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:22.730
What? You invited her?

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:26.180
<i>Wow, I didn't know Tateyan was so forward.</i>

00:04:26.180 --> 00:04:28.190
He's a very fast chubbo.

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:32.820
At your age, your abilities to approach 
the opposite sex will vary.

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:34.360
<i>Dr. Love.</i>

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:35.480
<i>Where'd he come from?</i>

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:38.380
I haven't matured sufficiently to achieve 
reproduction despite having lived for 500 years,

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:41.220
so my family line is in danger 
of ending with me.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:46.090
But people like him end up being well-liked by the
 opposite sex, and will leave behind many descendants.

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.420
Chuta, you know that transfer student?

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:51.630
I just talked to him for the first time.

00:04:51.630 --> 00:04:54.290
You seem weird and fun, too.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:55.430
I'm Tateyan.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:05:00.260
My name is Takurama... um, I forgot.

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:03.240
My real name is Taklamakan Strangelove.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.320
If you do that, then having an alias is pointless!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:08.790
That's a long name! 
Your nickname will be Takkun.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:09.800
Takkun?

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:11.640
Takkun, you'll go bowling, too, right?

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:12.450
Sure.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:15.360
So, Chuta.

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:20.570
I have a huge favor to ask you. 
I want you to invite Sonokata Misuzu.

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:22.330
Huh?

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:26.920
I've never talked to Sonokata. 
You guys seem close.

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:28.950
W-We're not...

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:30.240
I can't!

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:33.090
<i>I'll pass.</i>

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:34.760
See?

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:37.600
C-Could you at least consider it?

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:40.520
Veronica, Ninotchka, and Dr. Love 
will be there, too.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.020
It's just bowling.

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:44.170
I don't see a point in going.

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:45.890
<i>Come on, please?</i>

00:05:45.890 --> 00:05:47.250
I decline.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:48.460
<i>Man...</i>

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:52.040
More importantly, why didn't you 
ask me in person?

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:54.110
Using your police badge 
for a personal matter is...

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:55.490
<i>I don't have a choice!</i>

00:05:55.970 --> 00:06:00.080
You don't like the smell of my SPH...

00:06:01.390 --> 00:06:04.750
<i>I-I told you that was a 
misunderstanding on my part...</i>

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:08.920
You're lying! You said you were just dealing 
with it for the sake of the mission!

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:11.480
That was... um...

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:14.080
Then why did you have a nose plug on?

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:15.500
When I looked in the mirror,

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:18.930
I suddenly thought my nose 
was lacking something...

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:21.410
What the heck? So that 
was just an accessory?

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:22.940
Yes...

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:25.290
It doesn't look good on you at all!

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:29.190
How would you know that? 
You're picking a fight with me like a child!

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:32.770
Hey, you two! Don't use this line 
for personal matters!

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:34.090
<i>Chief Laine!</i>

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:36.650
Your police badge isn't a cell phone!

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:39.750
<i>Jeez, you two...</i>

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:43.500
Since I heard everything you were saying, 
I'm going to say this as your superior...

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.620
Misuzu, you go bowling, too.

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:51.160
You should communicate with the new team.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:52.810
That is an order.

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:54.420
B-But...

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:55.940
Oh, and also...

00:06:56.430 --> 00:07:01.550
There were weak traces of SPH detected 
at the bowling alley near there.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:07:05.650
<b>HIROBORI 
Bowl</b>

00:07:01.550 --> 00:07:05.640
Right now, it could just be an error, 
but go check it out, just in case.

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:08.140
If it's work, I'll go.

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:10.560
Good. Go have fun!

00:07:11.050 --> 00:07:12.760
Isn't that great, Chuta?

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:14.190
Thank goodness.

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:17.820
You're such a worrywart, Chief.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.100
That's not true.

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:24.000
<b>HIROBORI 
Bowl</b>

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.540
All right, I'm getting fired up!

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.850
This is pretty exciting, isn't it?

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:28.540
Yeah, really exciting.

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:31.120
It's been about a hundred years 
since I last went bowling.

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:32.780
A-A hundred years?!

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:35.840
You've bowled before, right, Sonokata?

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:39.270
Yes. But the main objective 
today is to investigate.

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:44.330
<i>And when I got to the airport, there were 
so many cops that I was surprised.</i>

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:48.340
<i>They mentioned that notorious mafiosos from 
all around the world were coming to Japan.</i>

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:52.180
<i>I heard about that. Isn't there a succession 
ceremony for some Italian mafia boss?</i>

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:57.000
<i>Right, right. But why are they doing that 
in Japan if they're the Italian mafia?</i>

00:07:58.030 --> 00:08:00.320
All right. No unidentified SPH.

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:02.970
Nothing seems to be 
going on over here, either.

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:05.580
Indeed. There doesn't seem 
to be anyone suspicious.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:08.450
Thank you for helping out 
with the investigation.

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:11.920
Just like Chief Laine said, 
it's a sensor error, chu.

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:14.790
What's wrong? Let's hurry up and start!

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:19.260
Chuta, that's enough investigating 
for now. Let's bowl.

00:08:19.260 --> 00:08:21.430
But we can't let our guard down.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.490
I have to brace myself.

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:25.940
Wow, Chief got a strike!

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:26.560
Huh?

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.420
Wow, you're so good!

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:30.240
Huh?

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:31.930
Huh?

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:34.610
Huh?!

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.670
Hey! What are the chief and 
the others doing here?

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:40.470
Dr. Love, are you sure you 
checked the people here?!

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:44.250
They aren't suspicious individuals 
worthy of investigating.

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.740
Th-That's true, but...

00:08:46.740 --> 00:08:49.630
Tonto-san and Deputy Chief Riggs stand out.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.500
They're clearly aliens.

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:53.520
I wonder what cosplay that is.

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:54.960
It looks so real!

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:57.270
Apparently, it's fine.

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:01.100
I'm sure they would never think 
they're actually aliens...

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:03.380
Hey, took you long enough.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:05.260
What are you guys doing here?

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:08.870
We're the bureau's bowling enthusiasts.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:12.560
We hadn't bowled any lately, so when 
we heard that you guys were going,

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.240
we just couldn't hold back anymore.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.350
Well, you should have...

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:18.640
You all know each other?

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:21.490
Tateyan?! U-Um, well...

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:26.460
They're the president and workers at the 
bento factory where my mom works part-time.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:30.580
Oh, r-right! We were just introduced, too.

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.710
That's an amazing cosplay.

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:36.310
I get that all the time!

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:40.710
Don't pay us any mind. Have fun.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:47.730
You're using the next lane over!
 We couldn't miss you!

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:58.990
<b>Riggs</b>

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:58.990
<b>Tonto</b>

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:11.830
There!

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:14.520
So close!

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:15.630
Don't worry about it, Nino.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.630
What the heck is that?

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:18.710
It's a balloon!

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.630
It's so ugly! But it's so bouncy!

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:24.370
So mean...

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.890
He can't let them know that he's an alien.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:29.890
That's actually mine. 
Would you mind giving it back?

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:30.690
Sure.

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:34.140
Are you okay?

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:39.600
I want to bowl with everyone, too.

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:43.020
All right! Aim for it!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.530
Let's see...

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:52.140
So far, Tateyan's at the top.

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:55.540
The ēlDLIVE members' aren't scoring 
as high as I thought they would...

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:57.270
True...

00:10:57.270 --> 00:11:01.150
All right, while I'm at the top, 
I'm gonna head to the bathroom, Takkun.

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:03.050
Take your time expelling your body's waste.

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:07.200
He's a rather straightforward fellow.

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.180
He's a great guy.

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:12.060
He's exactly what you think a high school boy
 would be like, so I don't like him.

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.580
I'm surprised you agreed 
to go bowling, Nino.

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:16.940
You're the one who said that we 
should be forward with interactions

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:19.950
so we can get used to life 
on Earth, Veronica.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:24.070
Well, the competition is fun. Though I'm 
getting stressed with this handicap.

00:11:24.480 --> 00:11:25.320
Handicap?

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:30.200
We have a special rule that we can only score
 if we make a split on the first throw.

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:34.880
That's when there's a space between the pins, right? 
You're <i>trying</i> to do that?!

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:33.080
<b>Split</b>

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:38.090
Yup. And of course,
 using SPH is not allowed.

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:40.520
I'm sorry that we're being so frivolous.

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:42.210
<i>They're on a completely different level!</i>

00:11:42.540 --> 00:11:44.530
I'm just playing normally.

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:46.620
It's troublesome, 
so I'm just using one finger.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:48.010
What do you even mean?

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:51.990
By the way, I'm closing my eyes and only 
using the pinky on my left hand when I throw.

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:53.510
You don't have to go that far.

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:58.520
With the handicap, 
Misuzu and I have really close scores.

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:00.910
But... that ends now!

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.860
I'm not gonna lose to Misuzu.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:06.100
Veronica is provoking Misuzu again.

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:08.740
Um... Why are you being so 
competitive with Sonokata?

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:11.690
I'm not being competitive. 
It's just obvious that I should beat her.

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:12.490
Huh?

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:16.420
I'm a descendant of the 
Kushutonian race that brought peace

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:19.950
to the Polar Galaxy for 
thirty centuries with military force.

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:23.760
The Kushutonian genes are 
otherwise known as victory genes.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:25.810
We are born to win.

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:28.220
So I'm not going to lose to Misuzu!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.370
What kind of weird reasoning is that?

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:33.220
Apparently, there are a lot of different 
ways of thinking in the universe.

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:39.450
And both my mom and dad are Kushutonians, 
so I inherited a ton of victory genes,

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:42.140
and I'm an ultra-rare pureblood!

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:45.200
Not bad.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:50.580
I think that's a rather weak reason 
to provoke Officer Sonokata.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:52.280
This is just a hunch,

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:55.960
but there was probably some trouble 
in the past that's the cause of your discord.

00:12:57.760 --> 00:12:58.570
You okay?

00:12:58.570 --> 00:12:59.710
Y-Yes...

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.790
Did I hit the nail on the head?

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:02.650
Huh?!

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:04.960
What happened to them in the past?

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:08.760
Um... Well, that's...

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:09.580
Nino.

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:11.300
I-I don't know anything!

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:17.680
If you keep asking stupid questions, 
your life might end today.

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.980
Hey, Ch-Chief Laine...

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.140
These dumplings are great.

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:24.480
You've got potential if you 
can appreciate their taste!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.170
One more cup of petroleum!

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:28.240
Coming right up!

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:30.200
They're not even looking over here!

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:32.210
Wh-What's going on?

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:38.280
Now I can bowl, too, chu.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:40.230
I-Is that...

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:41.890
It's Sonokata's mom!

00:13:41.890 --> 00:13:42.960
Huh?!

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:48.770
Misuzu, it's your mom, chu.

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:52.050
M-Mom?

00:13:52.050 --> 00:13:54.110
You guys have the same eyes.

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:57.920
They really do look alike. I can't tell 
which one is actually Misuzu.

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:59.810
J-Jeez, Veronica.

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.310
Now then...

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:06.820
I'm going to surpass everyone's 
scores at full power, chu!

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:10.530
Go!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:13.560
Ch-Chu?!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.070
Chu!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.070
Ow, ow, ow, chu.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:31.710
So this is what the mechanisms
 down here look like.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:33.880
Chu?

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:40.220
He's suspicious, chu.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:43.860
Exporting insects outside of Earth 
is prohibited, chu.

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:48.400
I'm an officer of the
 Space Police ēlDLIVE, chu!

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:50.790
I want to have a word with you, chu.

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:58.470
If you resist, I'll arrest you for
 interfering with a public servant, chu.

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:00.520
You have the right 
to remain silent... chu?!

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:05.960
A-Anything you say can and will be used against you

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:11.290
in an intergalactic court of l-law... chu!

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:15.090
Is Sonokata's mom okay?

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:18.720
She's fine. She just had a late shift,
 so she's sleep-deprived.

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:23.460
Those two are getting even more hostile. 
I wonder if it'll be okay...

00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:25.850
Veronica is provoking her too much.

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:30.780
Hey, Misuzu. How about the loser 
of this game has to grovel?

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.820
I see that the things you say 
are as immature as ever.

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.150
They'll have to grovel,

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:38.070
then go around the bureau once blowing 
a chikuwa like a whistle with their nose.

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:39.630
Whoa, she went with it?

00:15:39.630 --> 00:15:42.820
I'm pretty sure something terrifying 
will happen, no matter who wins.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:45.000
All right, I'm going for it!

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.510
The most pins you can get 
with a split, eight!

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:51.750
I'll show you the power of a 
100% pureblooded Kushutonian!

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.920
Oh, you're not 100%.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:54.590
Huh?!

00:15:57.380 --> 00:16:00.400
Oh, man, I got a strike.

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.140
Wow...

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:04.360
Wait, what do you mean?

00:16:04.360 --> 00:16:08.640
During the remote control SPH incident, 
a lot of your organs shut down.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:12.320
So I used the latest artificial
 organ technology to compensate.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:15.110
They'll soon adapt to your body.

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:16.990
No...

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:20.220
My purity...

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:21.500
P-Purity?

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:22.570
Unforgivable!

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:24.280
I'm in shock...

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:27.690
But at least you're alive.

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:28.500
He's right.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:32.000
I was happy that you recovered so quickly.

00:16:32.910 --> 00:16:34.310
Really?

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:35.460
Of course!

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:36.910
Can you stand?

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:38.720
Please move.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.340
You're in the way. It's my turn.

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:42.650
Misuzu!

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:45.090
Why are you saying that now, anyway?

00:16:45.090 --> 00:16:46.470
A doctor should say that sooner!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:52.170
Sorry. It's imprudent, but after 
I treated you, I got excited about

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:55.750
challenging myself with how many 
critically injured patients I could save.

00:16:56.270 --> 00:16:58.860
Dr. Love sure does a lot of things 
that are imprudent.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.840
I'll tell you sooner next time, 
about anything that might bother you.

00:17:03.390 --> 00:17:05.410
By the way, Officer Sonokata...

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:06.490
Yes?

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:08.460
The nose plug you're wearing...

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.570
Are you aware

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:14.180
that it's a nose accessory that Tikvahkians 
wear when they come of age?

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:19.940
If you put it on your nose, your nostrils 
narrow and you won't be able to smell.

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:22.170
I'm aware.

00:17:22.550 --> 00:17:26.680
I'm only wearing it as an accessory. 
Please leave me alone.

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:28.970
Let's go, Veronica.

00:17:28.970 --> 00:17:30.570
Look at Misuzu's nose.

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:35.310
Congratulations!

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:39.980
Now you're an adult, too!

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:41.700
Hooray!

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:46.000
To go along with the coming of age ceremony 
coinciding with the release of SPH,

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:49.660
three days after putting it on, 
the mechanism flies off and destroys itself.

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:51.670
That's what I wanted to say.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:52.410
Bye bye!

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.380
Is my smell okay?

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:02.370
So it does smell...

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:05.850
No! My nose just itched.

00:18:05.850 --> 00:18:07.970
I'm going to bowl now, 
so please move over there.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:21.490
Misuzu?

00:18:31.320 --> 00:18:32.510
Sympathy!

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.340
No way...

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:45.380
Sonokata?

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:48.880
Misuzu?!

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:54.300
Hey, what are you...

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:57.650
I'm making her arrogant, irritating face 
more pleasant to look at.

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:01.320
There's no need to worry.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:02.180
Huh?

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.410
The reason I came today was to see

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:07.710
how Officer Sonokata was doing 
after going back to work.

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:12.190
Jeez...

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:14.000
Man, I'm no match for you.

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:20.430
Oh, no! There's an unidentified SPH signal!

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:23.380
There's a signal here.

00:19:23.380 --> 00:19:25.210
What are they doing?

00:19:25.210 --> 00:19:26.230
Who knows?

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:39.960
Bring me more matcha, chu.

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:43.720
You started the party already?

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:48.230
That bowling place was 
actually a secret factory

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:51.450
that the Lebownians were using 
to smuggle Earth insects.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:58.000
The factory was covered in special walls 
that hides their SPH, so we couldn't find them.

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.460
Well done.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:01.420
Yoyosa!

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:04.760
Well done, and right after coming 
back to work, Misuzu.

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:05.870
Boo.

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:08.170
The ball I threw just happened to hit them.

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:10.640
You passed out right before you threw it.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:14.310
Are you okay? You seemed to have 
a hard time breathing, Misuzu.

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:16.380
<i>It's because of my smell!</i>

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:17.720
I'm anemic.

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:22.070
I hadn't eaten black hanpen lately.

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:23.990
<i>Why are you lying?</i>

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:27.200
<i>Do you really not want people to know that 
you can't work because of the smell that badly?</i>

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:30.500
Perfect timing, then.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.220
Let's do a physical.

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:36.160
Managing your health is my job.

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:38.220
Good for you, Misuzu.

00:20:38.220 --> 00:20:41.790
I'm fine! My primary 
physician is Dr. Isaac.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:44.240
You've misunderstood me.

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:48.050
I just want to see your body 
and touch it.

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:49.800
<i>He actually said it!</i>

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:51.880
Stay away!

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:53.900
H-Hey, Misuzu!

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:55.390
This is self-defense.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:57.780
Such pretty SPH.

00:20:57.780 --> 00:21:01.690
I want to grab the SPH veins 
that are right under your armpits.

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.060
If you come any closer, I will cut you!

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:04.600
Armpits?

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:08.220
The stuff that Dr. Love is interested in 
is so chaste, it's kind of a problem.

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:10.320
One vote for Misuzu's use of self-defense!

00:21:10.320 --> 00:21:13.030
I'm just going to grab and 
squeeze right inside your sleeve.

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:14.830
I'll cut you!

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:16.580
Don't do anything rash, Misuzu!

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:18.120
Stop, chu!

00:21:22.530 --> 00:21:24.910
Love is very athletic.

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:26.830
This is no time to be admiring him!

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:31.280
<i>Yeah... Sonokata fainting like that...</i>

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:35.980
<i>That's just going to make me even 
more self-conscious about my smell!</i>

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:10.630
Tateyan got his hair shaved off by Sonokata...

00:23:10.630 --> 00:23:14.600
Dr. Love was able to use space's
 latest hair regrowth technology

00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:17.200
to get his hair back to normal...

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:21.040
But sometimes, he looks like a 
completely different person.

00:23:22.470 --> 00:23:25.000
Next week on <i>ēlDLIVE</i>...

00:23:25.420 --> 00:23:29.030
I thought there were 
three left, but... Thanks, Nino.

00:23:29.030 --> 00:23:29.880
No problem.

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:33.510
Apparently, Assistant Inspector Chips liked 
yours so much, he's been drinking it.

00:23:33.510 --> 00:23:34.220
Huh?

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:35.720
Next time on <i>ēlDLIVE,</i>

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:37.290
"Capture That Face."

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Next Time
Capture That Face</b>

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:39.270
So good! One more!
